(Before submitting to the Somerset Covenants Review Committee \(CRC\):) Tj
0 -14 Td
(1. Confirm your division's CC&Rs apply \(most lots do; a few do not\).) Tj
0 -14 Td
(2. CRC review is separate from any City of Bellevue permit.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(3. Somerset is a view community - document view impact on neighboring lots.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(4. Use Form B \(minor remodel\) for typical fence work unless CRC directs Form A.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(5. Prepare a site plan with lot lines, house, slope, and proposed fence location.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(6. Include elevations, heights, materials, and finish samples.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(7. Download current forms and Fence Guidelines at somerset98006.org.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(8. Email the packet to crc@somerset98006.org. Do not start until written approval.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(9. Keep photos and approval docs for closeout and resale.) Tj
